    # emma "I think we can do a meeting..."
    emma "我觉得可以见一面……"

# game/scripts/Characters/aurora.rpy:1860
translate chinese_simp aurora_checkup_1a4e502a:

    # emma "But even if it goes well, I don't know how we'd use them."
    emma "但就算谈得好，我也不确定怎么安排她们。"

